{"id":"8133fc32a2cf7026","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-collapsing-duplicating.md","title":"坍缩规则与复制规则","display":"df-collapsing-duplicating — 坍缩规则与复制规则","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-collapsing-duplicating","aliases":["56-df-collapsing-duplicating"],"display":"df-collapsing-duplicating — 坍缩规则与复制规则","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]"],"source_section":"§2.3 Definition 2.3.3; §5.9 Example 5.9.6","source_printed_pages":"39, 176","source_ocr_blocks":[60,197],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-collapsing-duplicating"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-collapsing-duplicating</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-collapsing-duplicating — 坍缩规则与复制规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.3 Definition 2.3.3; §5.9 Example 5.9.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"39, 176"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span><span>197</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,V,T\">\\(\\Sigma,V,T\\)</span> 及合法规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98838138a402c043\" href=\"?note=98838138a402c043\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-rule\">56-df-rewrite-rule</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l,r,t\\in T\">\\(l,r,t\\in T\\)</span>。位置和子项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{occ}_x(t)\\coloneqq|\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):t|_p=x\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{occ}_x(t)\\coloneqq|\\{p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t):t|_p=x\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CollapsingRule}(l,r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land r\\in V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CollapsingRule}(l,r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land r\\in V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DuplicatingRule}(l,r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land\\exists x\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{occ}_x(l)&lt;\\operatorname{occ}_x(r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DuplicatingRule}(l,r)\\iff(l,r)\\in\\operatorname{Rule}(\\Sigma,V)\\land\\exists x\\in V\\;(\\operatorname{occ}_x(l)&lt;\\operatorname{occ}_x(r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Collapsing}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\iff\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{CollapsingRule}(l,r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Collapsing}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\iff\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{CollapsingRule}(l,r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Duplicating}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\iff\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{DuplicatingRule}(l,r).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Duplicating}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\iff\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\;\\operatorname{DuplicatingRule}(l,r).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按变量出现次数判定复制，不能把“右边同一变量出现两次”单独作为充分条件：F(x,x)→G(x,x) 不是复制规则。occ 是有限位置子集的基数，良定义为自然数。系统谓词表示至少含一条相应规则，不要求每条规则都有该性质。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-rule","status":"resolved","id":"98838138a402c043","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"tar