置计数；$g\\in\\mathcal F$，$k=\\operatorname{ar}(g)$，$t_1,\\ldots,t_k\\in T$；$\\operatorname{fun}:T\\to\\mathbb N$ 通过自由有限项结构递归定义。$u,f,l:\\mathcal G\\to\\mathbb N$ 为以下定义的三个目标测度。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-342","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-collapsing-duplicating.md]]"},{"id":"0a047c291d67a9f2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]] 的 $\\Sigma_i,R_i,V,T_i,\\to_i$ 及并系统 $\\Sigma,R,T,\\to$；两个函数符号集不交，原分量和混合项的关系分别在各自签名中计算。 $\\mathrm{Terminating}$ 见 [[56-df-terminating]]；$\\operatorname{Collapsing}$、$\\operatorname{Duplicating}$ 见 [[56-df-collapsing-duplicating]]。以下 $C_i,D_i$ 为局部命题缩写。"}],"outgoing":["98838138a402c043","da02033e6d596cae","c3157a722a0edf96"]}